<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Bangers & Mash" description="Privacy Policy for Bangers & Mash by Oak and Main Developers LLC.">
  <section class="wrap" style="max-width: 800px; margin-top: 4rem; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: August 2026</p>

    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>Welcome to Bangers & Mash. This Privacy Policy explains how Oak and Main Developers LLC ("we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, and discloses information about you when you access or use our website (bangersandmash.uk).</p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>We only collect data that is necessary to provide and improve our services. When you accept our analytics cookies, we use Cloudflare Web Analytics to collect anonymized usage data (such as page views and basic device metrics). We do not collect personally identifiable information unless you explicitly provide it to us.</p>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the anonymized data we collect to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Monitor and analyze trends, usage, and activities in connection with our website.</li>
      <li>Improve our website's performance and user experience.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Your Consent</h2>
    <p>By default, no analytics tracking occurs. Tracking only begins if you explicitly consent via our cookie banner. You may withdraw your consent at any time by clearing your browser cookies.</p>

    <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:</p>
    <address>
      <strong>Oak and Main Developers LLC</strong><br/>
      2108 N St.<br/>
      Sacramento, CA 95816<br/>
      Operating State: CA
    </address>
  </section>
</Layout>
